WEBVTT

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:02.559
use a ruthless design-to-cost approach.

00:09:02.583 --> 00:09:04.184
In the design phase,

00:09:04.208 --> 00:09:06.333
even before production starts,

00:09:07.417 --> 00:09:11.309
they look for the right products
at the right costs

00:09:11.333 --> 00:09:13.226
with the right parameters.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.309
Zymergen developed Hyaline

00:09:15.333 --> 00:09:19.851
a transparent, printable
circuit for electronics,

00:09:19.875 --> 00:09:22.309
produced by fermentation.

00:09:22.333 --> 00:09:26.934
And this biobased film is cheaper

00:09:26.958 --> 00:09:31.601
and has better properties
than the existing one,